{"seq":1,"slug":"settlement-payout-ledger-reconciliation","title":"结算打款与卖家账户账本：三方对账、余额滚动与差异处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/settlement-reconciliation-reporting/settlement-payout-ledger-reconciliation","wordCount":2726,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"结算打款与卖家账户账本-三方对账-余额滚动与差异处理\">结算打款与卖家账户账本：三方对账、余额滚动与差异处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>账单出完，卖家的钱还没有到银行卡。中间隔着一段资金在途的账务流转：平台按账期发起<strong>打款</strong>（payout / disbursement），资金经过清算银行、跨境通道、可能的中间行，若干个工作日后落到卖家的收款账户。这段路程里，卖家账户的<strong>账本</strong>（ledger）余额不断滚动，而任何一处对不上，卖家就会在后台看到「账单金额与到账金额不符」。对账要做的事，就是把这条链路上三份彼此独立的记录对齐。</p>\n<p>三方对账（three-way reconciliation）的三方是：<strong>平台侧账本</strong>（订单、佣金、退款、调账等分录驱动的内部账）、<strong>结算报告侧</strong>（发往卖家的报表，如 Amazon 的 Settlement Report、eBay 的 payout/transaction 明细、Shopify Payments 的 payout、Stripe Connect 的 balance transaction 流水）、<strong>银行侧</strong>（实际入账的银行对账单）。三者用不同粒度、不同时点、不同币种记录同一批资金，因此对账不是「比对两份相同报表」，而是<strong>建立跨源的外键映射并容忍时间差</strong>。</p>\n<p>账本本身必须是 append-only 的：任何余额变动都记为一笔带类型、带方向、带时间戳的<strong>分录</strong>（entry），余额是分录的累加结果而非可覆盖的字段。这条约束决定了后续所有差异处理都走「补一笔冲正分录」，而不是「改掉一笔旧分录」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[平台账本分录&lt;br/&gt;sale/commission/refund/adjustment] --&gt; B[账期结算&lt;br/&gt;statement / financial event group]&#10;    B --&gt; C[打款批次&lt;br/&gt;payout / disbursement]&#10;    C --&gt; D[清算与跨境通道&lt;br/&gt;in-transit]&#10;    D --&gt; E[银行到账&lt;br/&gt;bank statement line]&#10;    A -.三方对账.-&gt; F{差异分类&lt;br/&gt;match / timing / short / dup / fx}&#10;    B -.三方对账.-&gt; F&#10;    E -.三方对账.-&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|可自愈| G[挂账至下期&lt;br/&gt;suspense carry]&#10;    F --&gt;|需人工| H[调整分录&lt;br/&gt;adjustment entry]&#10;    G --&gt; A&#10;    H --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[平台账本分录&lt;br/&gt;sale/commission/refund/adjustment] --&gt; B[账期结算&lt;br/&gt;statement / financial event group]\n    B --&gt; C[打款批次&lt;br/&gt;payout / disbursement]\n    C --&gt; D[清算与跨境通道&lt;br/&gt;in-transit]\n    D --&gt; E[银行到账&lt;br/&gt;bank statement line]\n    A -.三方对账.-&gt; F{差异分类&lt;br/&gt;match / timing / short / dup / fx}\n    B -.三方对账.-&gt; F\n    E -.三方对账.-&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|可自愈| G[挂账至下期&lt;br/&gt;suspense carry]\n    F --&gt;|需人工| H[调整分录&lt;br/&gt;adjustment entry]\n    G --&gt; A\n    H --&gt; A</pre><p>三条恒等式贯穿全篇，任一破裂即产生差异：账本内 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>balance</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>balance</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>entries</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{balance}_{t} = \\text{balance}_{t-1} + \\sum \\text{entries}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">balance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">balance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">entries</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；打款批次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>payout</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>batch</mtext></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>settled</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{payout} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{batch}} \\text{settled}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">settled</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；银行侧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bankCredit</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>payout</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>channelFee</mtext><mo>±</mo><mtext>fxDiff</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bankCredit} = \\text{payout} - \\text{channelFee} \\pm \\text{fxDiff}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bankCredit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">channelFee</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fxDiff</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卖家账户账本-可用-待定与储备三层余额\">卖家账户账本：可用、待定与储备三层余额</h2><p>卖家在后台看到的那个数字，是多个余额分层叠加的结果，而非一个数。主流平台几乎都收敛到同一套模型——Stripe Connect 明确把账户余额拆成 <code>pending</code>（已入账但未到期，不可打款）与 <code>available</code>（可打款），并在平台账户上额外维护一个 <code>connect_reserved</code> 储备余额用于覆盖子账户的负余额；Amazon 的 Finances 接口则用交易状态表达同一件事，<code>transactionStatus</code> 取 <code>DEFERRED</code>、<code>RELEASED</code>、<code>DEFERRED_RELEASED</code>，延后原因记在 <code>deferralReason</code>（如 <code>B2B</code> 表示赊销订单、<code>DD7</code> 表示按配送日期政策），释放日期记在 <code>maturityDate</code>。结构相同：<strong>一笔收入先进入「待定」，到达成熟时点后才释放进「可用」，打款再从「可用」扣减。</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>available</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>available</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>released</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>payout</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>reserveHold</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>reserveRelease</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{available}_t = \\text{available}_{t-1} + \\text{released}_t - \\text{payout}_t - \\text{reserveHold}_t + \\text{reserveRelease}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">available</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">available</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">released</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8592em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserveHold</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserveRelease</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>储备金不是平台「扣了不退」的钱。Stripe 对负余额建立了明确的资金回收闭环：子账户出现负余额时，平台侧按 <code>reserve_transaction</code> 类型冻结对应资金补足，余额回正后按同类交易释放；若负余额持续 180 天，Stripe 生成 <code>connect_collection_transfer</code> 类型交易，从储备划拨使账户归零，并建议随后关闭该账户。此外，Stripe 按卖家所在国设定了法定保留期——泰国 10 天、美国 2 年、其他国家 90 天——这段资金在法律上不可打款。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>余额层级</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型来源字段</th>\n<th>是否可打款</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pending / deferred</td>\n<td>已确认收入，未到成熟时点</td>\n<td><code>transactionStatus=DEFERRED</code>、<code>maturityDate</code>、Stripe <code>pending</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>available</td>\n<td>已到期可提现</td>\n<td>Stripe <code>available</code>、Amazon <code>RELEASED</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reserve / hold</td>\n<td>风控或法定保留</td>\n<td><code>connect_reserved</code>、Amazon Account Reserve、<code>reserveHold</code></td>\n<td>否（到期释放）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>negative</td>\n<td>退款/拒付导致的负余额</td>\n<td>Stripe 负余额、<code>connect_collection_transfer</code></td>\n<td>触发补款或回收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这三层显式建模成四个余额桶（pending、available、reserve、negative），而非一个「余额」字段，是账本设计的第一个正确决定：它让「为什么钱取不出来」这类客服问题变成可查询的事实，而不是估计。延后与释放的时点本身也要版本化——成熟规则一旦改动，历史待定金额的释放计划不能被新规则重新计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三方对账-从外键映射到可执行的匹配\">三方对账：从外键映射到可执行的匹配</h2><p>匹配的工程本质是<strong>跨源主键映射</strong>。平台账本与结算报告之间靠 <code>SETTLEMENT_ID</code> / <code>FINANCIAL_EVENT_GROUP_ID</code> 这类账期组标识连接；结算报告与打款之间靠 <code>DISBURSEMENT_ID</code>；打款与银行入账之间靠平台的付款参考号加银行流水号。Amazon 的 Finances 接口同时暴露 <code>SETTLEMENT_ID</code>、<code>DISBURSEMENT_ID</code>、<code>TRANSFER_ID</code>、<code>ORDER_ID</code>、<code>REFUND_ID</code> 等一组关联标识，其中可作查询过滤的只有 <code>ORDER_ID</code> 与 <code>FINANCIAL_EVENT_GROUP_ID</code>——这说明对账扫描通常从订单或账期组入口进入，再靠返回的关联标识向外反查。</p>\n<p>匹配算法按辨别力从强到弱分层推进，只有上一层无法判定时才降级：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>精确键匹配</strong>——<code>settlement_id</code> + <code>order_id</code> + <code>amount</code> 全等，直接命中，占比应超过九成。</li>\n<li><strong>容差匹配</strong>——金额在容忍带内（取整差、小额四舍五入差），标记为疑似而非匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>时间窗匹配</strong>——金额与业务键一致但 <code>postedDate</code> 跨期，判为时序差异，用挂账结转而非调整。</li>\n<li><strong>模糊匹配</strong>——仅金额相近，需人工复核，绝不可自动勾销。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>匹配粒度必须统一到<strong>条目级而非汇总级</strong>：汇总级对账（账单总额 vs 打款总额）只能证明「大致没丢钱」，无法定位是哪一笔错；条目级对账虽然计算量大，但每一条差异都自带定位信息。这与计费引擎里「逐笔可重放」的要求同源，幂等键与重放协议见 <code>../2_fee-calculation-charge-engine/1_charge-engine-architecture-idempotency.md</code>。</p>\n<p>Amazon 接口的另一个约束值得写进设计：<code>postedAfter</code> / <code>postedBefore</code> 查询<strong>不允许跨越超过 180 天</strong>。这意味着对账任务不能假设「随时全量拉取」，必须做增量拉取与本地落库，且落库记录要保留原始关联标识以备后续追查。跨年对账、历史账期重算都会撞上这个 180 天窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打款批次的账务闭环-在途-到账与汇兑\">打款批次的账务闭环：在途、到账与汇兑</h2><p>打款不是账本的一条普通分录，而是一个有生命周期的<strong>批次对象</strong>。它需要自己的状态机，以及一条从「批次生成」到「银行确认」的完整证据链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P0[批次生成&lt;br/&gt;batch created] --&gt; P1[已提交通道&lt;br/&gt;submitted]&#10;    P1 --&gt; P2[在途&lt;br/&gt;in_transit]&#10;    P2 --&gt; P3[银行已入账&lt;br/&gt;paid / bank_confirmed]&#10;    P2 --&gt; P4[退回&lt;br/&gt;failed / returned]&#10;    P4 --&gt; P5[资金回退账本&lt;br/&gt;reversal entry]&#10;    P5 --&gt; P0&#10;    P3 --&gt; P6[对账已确认&lt;br/&gt;reconciled]\">graph TD\n    P0[批次生成&lt;br/&gt;batch created] --&gt; P1[已提交通道&lt;br/&gt;submitted]\n    P1 --&gt; P2[在途&lt;br/&gt;in_transit]\n    P2 --&gt; P3[银行已入账&lt;br/&gt;paid / bank_confirmed]\n    P2 --&gt; P4[退回&lt;br/&gt;failed / returned]\n    P4 --&gt; P5[资金回退账本&lt;br/&gt;reversal entry]\n    P5 --&gt; P0\n    P3 --&gt; P6[对账已确认&lt;br/&gt;reconciled]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>在途期</strong>（in-transit）是差异高发段。批次已从卖家 <code>available</code> 扣减，银行尚未入账，此时两侧都有记录但金额时点不一致，属于<strong>预期内时序差异</strong>，对账状态应记为 <code>pending</code> 而非 <code>break</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>退回</strong>（failed / returned）必须触发资金回退分录，把金额还原到 <code>available</code> 并保留原因码。忽略回退会永久制造一笔账实不符。</li>\n<li><strong>净额打款与币种</strong>：跨境批次常把多个账期或币种的净额合并打款，此时「一条打款对应多张账单、多个币种」是常态。对账键必须支持一对多，且批次头要记录每张账单的分配额（allocation），否则无法把打款金额还原回账单。</li>\n<li><strong>汇兑差异</strong>：本币账单折算成结算币种、再经通道折算成银行入账币种，两次折算在两个时点发生，产生的 <code>fxDiff</code> 既不是平台少付也不是银行少给，应单独作为汇兑损益行（FX gain/loss line）入账，而不是塞进某笔订单的成本里。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fxDiff</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>bankCredit</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>payoutAmount</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>channelFee</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fxDiff} = \\text{bankCredit} - \\text{payoutAmount} \\times r_{\\text{batch}} + \\text{channelFee}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fxDiff</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bankCredit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payoutAmount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">channelFee</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>批次到账确认（<code>reconciled</code>）不应只看金额相等，还要校验付款参考号、币种、日期窗口三个维度；仅金额相符的匹配会掩盖串批——两笔同额打款互相错配，账面平但实质错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异处理-分类-根因与调整分录\">差异处理：分类、根因与调整分录</h2><p>差异处理的成熟做法是把差异先<strong>分类</strong>再决定处置，而不是见到不符就挂人工。分类维度是「是否由时序造成」与「是否需改变已入账金额」两个正交问题，由此得到四类处置策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>典型根因</th>\n<th>处置策略</th>\n<th>是否改账</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序差异（timing）</td>\n<td>账期 cut-off 与银行入账日跨期、在途未落账</td>\n<td>挂账结转下期，状态 <code>pending</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额短差（short）</td>\n<td>通道费未计提、跨境中转行扣费</td>\n<td>补提费用分录冲平</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复入账（duplicate）</td>\n<td>幂等键失效、重放未去重</td>\n<td>生成同额冲正分录并告警</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无对应（unmatched）</td>\n<td>报告未到、标识缺失、币种错配</td>\n<td>进 suspended 科目等待配对，超期升级</td>\n<td>否（暂记）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>处理时要区分<strong>自愈</strong>与<strong>人工</strong>两条通道。时序差异与大部分无对应项属于自愈范畴：它们会在下一期报告中自然配对，引擎只需把未匹配项挂入一个 suspense 科目并在下一轮对账中优先重试——这与账单的「carry forward 至下期」是同一机制的延伸，账期结转的闭合恒等式已在 <code>../3_billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/1_billing-cycle-statement-generation.md</code> 中讨论。金额短差与重复入账则需要生成调整分录，且必须走「原分录不可改、新增冲正分录」的路径，保留完整审计轨迹。</p>\n<p>差异处理的最后一道防线是<strong>账实双向核对</strong>而非单向勾兑。只做「报告 → 账本」单向匹配会漏掉账本里有、报告里没有的「幽灵收入」；正确做法是双向遍历，两侧各自的孤儿项都要被显式列出并计数。对负余额这类已发生的实质损失，需要触发平台的资金回收流程（如前述的 180 天回收转账），并把回收动作记为一笔独立类型的分录，而不是把负余额悄悄抹掉。每个差异从发现到关闭都应留一条状态记录（<code>open</code> → <code>classified</code> → <code>suspended</code> → <code>adjusted</code> / <code>self_healed</code> → <code>closed</code>），使「本期差异有多少、多久关闭」成为可度量的运营指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>卖家账户余额是<strong>四层桶</strong>（pending / available / reserve / negative）而非单一字段；延后与释放时点必须版本化，<code>maturityDate</code> 一类的成熟规则不可被新规则回算历史。</li>\n<li>三方对账是<strong>跨源外键映射</strong>问题：平台账本、结算报告、银行流水各用不同粒度与时点记录同一资金，靠 <code>SETTLEMENT_ID</code> / <code>DISBURSEMENT_ID</code> 等关联标识连接。</li>\n<li>匹配要<strong>分层推进</strong>（精确键 → 容差 → 时间窗 → 模糊），并且必须做到<strong>条目级</strong>、<strong>双向</strong>，汇总级与单向对账只能证明「大致没丢钱」。</li>\n<li>打款批次是带生命周期的对象，必须建模在途、退回、净额一对多分配与两次折算产生的汇兑损益行；仅凭金额相等的匹配会掩盖串批。</li>\n<li>差异要<strong>先分类再处置</strong>：时序类挂账自愈，短差与重复类走冲正调整分录；账本 append-only，任何修正都是补一笔分录而非改旧账。</li>\n<li>对账引擎的对外契约是差异状态机（<code>open</code> → … → <code>closed</code>），使差异数量与关闭时长成为可运营、可审计的指标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结算打款与卖家账户账本：三方对账、余额滚动与差异处理","id":"结算打款与卖家账户账本-三方对账-余额滚动与差异处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"卖家账户账本：可用、待定与储备三层余额","id":"卖家账户账本-可用-待定与储备三层余额"},{"level":2,"text":"三方对账：从外键映射到可执行的匹配","id":"三方对账-从外键映射到可执行的匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"打款批次的账务闭环：在途、到账与汇兑","id":"打款批次的账务闭环-在途-到账与汇兑"},{"level":2,"text":"差异处理：分类、根因与调整分录","id":"差异处理-分类-根因与调整分录"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"费用争议工作流：举证、裁决规则与 SLA 度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/dispute-workflow-evidence-sla"},"next":{"title":"卖家费用报表与披露：费用明细下载、对账口径与费用结构分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/settlement-reconciliation-reporting/seller-fee-reporting-analytics"}}